  "body_text": "Canva\n⁠\n(opens in a new tab or window)\nShare\nCreate with Canva\n\nOne Meat Combo\n\n$25\n\nSelect one meat & choice of one side,\ncomplimented with garlic bread or corn\nbread.\n\nTwo Meat Combo\n\n$30\n\nSelect two meats & choice of one side,\ncomplimented with garlic bread or corn\nbread.\n\nThree Meat Combo\n\n$40\n\nSelect three meats & choice of two sides,\ncomplimented with garlic bread  or corn\nbread.\n\nThe Rustic Barrel \n\n611 Canal St. King City, CA 93930\n\nORDER TO GO: 831-601-1397\n\nHog Fries\n\n$12\n\nGolden, crispy fries topped with melted\ncheese & bacon bites. A crave-worthy\ncombo that hits the spot every time.\n\nClassic Quesadilla\n\n$10\n\nA golden, crispy tortilla folded and grilled\nto perfection, stuffed with a melty blend of\ncheeses. Pared with our house made\njalapeño ranch & pickled onions\n\nAdd protein of choice for $5\n\nChicken, Pulled Pork, Tri-Tip or Brisket\n\n\n\n\n\n\nMac Daddy Fries\n\n$17\n\nGolden crispy fries layered with melted\ncheese, smothered with our homemade\nmac n’ cheese, bacon crumbles & drizzled\nwith our house-made burger sauce.\n\nBARREL BITES\n\nChicken Wings\n\n$16\n\nCrispy chicken wings tossed in one of our\nsignature sauces, served with a side\nhouse-made ranch or bleu cheese\n\nBuffalo Sauce\n\nSweet Chili\n\nGarlic Parmesan\n\nBBQ\n\nHot Daddy Fries\n\n$17\n\nCrispy golden fries smothered in creamy\nmac & cheese, drizzled with our house-\nmade burger sauce, and finished with a\ndusting of fiery Hot Cheeto crumble for\nthe perfect crunch and kick..\n\nTri-Tip\n\nChicken\n\nSide Selections\n\nHomemade Mac n’ Cheese\n\nBeer Battered Onion Rings\n\nAvailable until sold out\n\nMEAT COMBOS\n\nBrisket\n\nPulled Pork\n\nPork Ribs\n\nSalad\n\nFries\n\nBarrel Beans\n\nRUSTIC FAVORITES\n\nSingle $20 Double $23 Triple $27\n\nO.G. Smash Burger\n\nA mouth watering Angus beef patty,\nsmashed & seared to perfection, American\ncheese, house-made burger sauce &\ngrilled onions, served on a brioche bun.\n\nBarrel Fries\n\nFull $25 Half $15\n\nGolden crisscut fries, layered with cheese,\nchoice of meat, drizzled with our house-\nmade burger sauce, BBQ sauce & topped\nwith coleslaw and pickled onions.\n\nRustic Burger\n\n$28\n\nSink your teeth into two grilled Angus\nbeef patties, layered with American\ncheese, grilled onions, topped with juicy\nbacon crumble, 2 golden crispy onion\nrings & drizzled with BBQ sauce. \n\nLoaded Barrel Fries\n\nGolden crisscut fries, layered with cheese,\nchoice of meat, drizzled with our house-\nmade burger sauce, BBQ sauce & topped\nwith homemade mac n’ cheese, coleslaw\nand pickled onions.\n\nFull $30 Half $20\n\nA juicy, smashed beef patty, layered with\nAmerican cheese, mayo, crisp lettuce,\nfresh sliced tomatoes, and thin-cut onions,\nall stacked on a toasted brioche bun. \n\nSmash Burger Deluxe\n\nSingle $22 Double $25 Triple $30\n\nBarrel Fries Meat Choices: \n\nTri-Tip, Chicken, Pulled Pork\n\nBurgers come with one side:\n\nFries, Onion Rings, Mac n Cheese, Salad\n\nCajun Dry Rub\n\nCowboy Candy\n\n$10\n\nFresh sliced jalapeños hand-dipped in beer\nbatter and fried golden brown, served\nwith a side of ranch for the perfect crunch\n\nListed prices reflect cash amount. Card\ntransactions will include applicable\nprocessing fees.\n\nORDER ONLINE\n\nOrder Doordash\n\nOrder Pick-up\n\n611 Canal St. King City, CA 93930\n\nThe Rustic Barrel\n\nORDER TO GO: 831-601-1397\n\nbarrel bites\n\nMeat combos\n\nrustic favorites\n\nChicken Wings\n\n$16\n\nCrispy chicken wings tossed in one of our signature sauces, served with a side house-made ranch or bleu cheese\n\nBuffalo Sauce\n\nBBQ\n\nSweet Chili\n\nGarlic Parmesan\n\nAvailable until sold out\n\nBurgers come with one side:\n\nFries, Onion Rings, Mac n Cheese, Salad\n\nTri-Tip\n\nChicken\n\nBrisket\n\nO.G. Smash Burger\n\nSingle $20 Double $23 Triple $27\n\nA mouth watering Angus beef patty, smashed & seared to perfection, American cheese, house-made burger sauce & grilled onions, served